  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Wages grow at fastest pace since 2023 – but prices are climbing even more quickly",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/18/wages-grow-at-fastest-pace-since-2023-but-prices-are-climbing-even-more-quickly",
      "description": "<p>Wage rates climb about 1 percentage point faster than before pandemic, triggering warnings of a sixth RBA rate rise </p><p>Wages grew at their fastest pace since late 2023 over the three months to September, buoyed up by this year’s boost to minimum pay rates for millions of lower paid workers – but still not fast enough to keep up with the rising cost of living.</p><p>The Australian Bureau of Statistics’ wage price index climbed by 1.1% in the most recent quarter, lifting the annual increase to 3.5% – a pace that economists said would keep the Reserve Bank on edge about the need for further interest rate hikes.</p><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/18/wages-grow-at-fastest-pace-since-2023-but-prices-are-climbing-even-more-quickly\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-18T04:33:40"
    },
    {
      "title": "Australia’s ‘problematic’ surrogacy laws could be transformed under proposed changes",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/law/2026/nov/18/australias-strict-surrogacy-laws-could-be-relaxed-under-proposed-changes",
      "description": "<p>Law reform body recommends ongoing ban on commercial surrogacy, but greater compensation for surrogates, and safeguards around who the child’s legal parents are</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Surrogates would be entitled to full compensation, with a nationally consistent framework ensuring domestic surrogacy is a viable option to parenthood, under proposed changes by Australia’s law reform body.</p><p>The Australian Law Reform Commission has been investigating how to better regulate surrogacy and harmonise laws so they are consistent with international legal obligations, while protecting human rights – particularly the rights and best interests of the child.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/law/2026/nov/18/australias-strict-surrogacy-laws-could-be-relaxed-under-proposed-changes\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-18T03:28:59"
    },
    {
      "title": "One Nation says it would cut Australia’s refugee intake by 90% under ‘tough stance’",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/18/one-nation-refugee-intake-immigration-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Pauline Hanson opens new war of words on immigration as Penny Wong accuses populist party of ‘dividing Australians’</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>One Nation has vowed to cut Australia’s refugee intake by 90% and scrap the permanent parent visa program under its latest hardline plan to slash migration.</p><p>Pauline Hanson announced the policy on Tuesday, labelling it a “tough” approach to migration. It was quickly criticised by political opponents and advocacy groups who labelled the announcement a “predictable and cheap” attack on refugees.</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/28/politics-really-newsletter-guardian-australia-free-best-daily-auspol-email-subscribe?CMP=copyembed\">Sign up for Guardian Australia’s Politics, really newsletter here</a></strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/18/one-nation-refugee-intake-immigration-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-18T00:53:51"
    }
